From 5358fd040e3181993cfdd66a85a9d7ec2d4e3846 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: build <build@localhost>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:20:11 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] Extensions: Kiwi-style app-menu integration on phones

No extension buttons in the phone toolbar (coordinator kept for the bridge/popups, container hidden).
'Extensions' app-menu row always opens chrome://extensions. One app-menu row per extension action
(name + untinted icon) appended at the end of the menu; tapping runs the action: popup anchored to
the app-menu button, or onClicked when there is no popup.
